(
K05 (2026-10-07): element-target contact (contact_target_element_group,
manual Professional 6.105) needs the mesh boundary (node_boundary,
6.875); the GNU now generates it when it is not given. Test
other/contac1 of the Professional 02-08-2026: node 2 (element 1,
group 1, velx 0.03) runs into element 2 (group 2, target). The
penalty exchanges momentum between the equal masses of node 2 and
node 3: after one step velx = 0.02 / 0.01 (Professional 0.02 / 0.01).
GNU before: no node_boundary, the element targets were skipped and
node 2 kept velx 0.03.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_velocity
end_initia
mesh -follow_material
timestep_predict_velocity -yes
node 1  0.
node 2  0.99
node 3  1
node 4  2
node 5  3
element 1  -bar2 1 2
element 2  -bar2 3 4
element 3  -bar2 4 5
element_group 1 1
element_group 2 2
element_group 3 2
node_dof 2 +0.03
group_type 1  -materi
group_materi_density 1  1.e6
group_type 2  -materi
group_materi_density 2  1.e6
contact_target_element_group  2
contact_penalty_velocity  1.e10
control_timestep   10  1. 1.
target_item  1  -node_dof 2 -velx
target_value 1  0.02 1.e-6
target_item  2  -node_dof 3 -velx
target_value 2  0.01 1.e-6
end_data
